1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Rule 6c-11 website disclosures (public, free, as of 2026-11-06)**\n\n**Portfolio holdings (daily):** Before the primary exchange opens each business day, post the full holdings used for that day's NAV, each with ticker, CUSIP or other identifier, description, quantity, and percentage weight.\n\n**Daily data (prior business day):** NAV, market price (closing price or NBBO midpoint), and premium/discount.\n\n**History:** A table or chart of daily premiums/discounts for the most recent calendar year plus completed quarters since. Younger funds show their full life.\n\n**Spread:** Median bid-ask spread over the most recent 30 days.\n\n**Sustained deviation:** If the premium/discount exceeds 2% for over seven consecutive trading days, post that fact and the factors believed to have materially contributed, by the next trading day, for at least one year.\n\n**Baskets:** No daily publication required. ETFs need basket policies and procedures and must keep AP basket records, including custom-basket documentation, for five years. Holdings and baskets can differ.","ttft_ms":1368,"type":"result","duration_ms":3758,"uuid":"a9e864a4-1352-4579-b28b-0bc8c0cb5300","ttft_stream_ms":1191,"time_to_request_ms":60,"first_content_frame_ms":1191,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
